{60}{Yes, yes... The Mummy problem rears its ugly head once again! Well, Tim knows a lot about the Mummy Tim does! In fact... Tim knows something that may interest you greatly. A book, written by the last adventurer to come here. Might help you it might!}{Yes, yes... The Mummy problem rears its ugly head once again! Well, Tim knows a lot about the Mummy Tim does! In fact... Tim knows something that may interest you greatly. A book, written by the last adventurer to come here. Might help you it might!}{}{}{}{}
