{70}{Well, that all depends on if you can actually read doesn’t it? Anyway, about a month ago now, an adventurer who called himself DarkUnderlord came through here and tried to help us out. He went up into the old mines outside of town and looked for the Mummy. Didn’t find anything though. Came back here to re-supply and then just ran off and left us! But... He did leave us his journal to put in the Public Library. }{Well, that all depends on if you can actually read doesn’t it? Anyway, about a month ago now, an adventurer who called himself DarkUnderlord came through here and tried to help us out. He went up into the old mines outside of town and looked for the Mummy. Didn’t find anything though. Came back here to re-supply and then just ran off and left us! But... He did leave us his journal to put in the Public Library. }{}{}{}{}
{71}{Good, can I get the journal from the Library?}{}{5}{}{90}{}
{80}{Well, reading might be a bit of a struggle for you! But I’m sure you can at least try! Anyway, about a month ago now, an adventurer who called himself DarkUnderlord came through here and tried to help us out. He went up into the old mines outside of town and looked for the Mummy. Didn’t find anything though. Came back here to re-supply and then just ran off and left us! But... He did leave us his journal to put in the Public Library.}{Well, reading might be a bit of a struggle for you! But I’m sure you can at least try! Anyway, about a month ago now, an adventurer who called himself DarkUnderlord came through here and tried to help us out. He went up into the old mines outside of town and looked for the Mummy. Didn’t find anything though. Came back here to re-supply and then just ran off and left us! But... He did leave us his journal to put in the Public Library.}{}{}{}{}
{81}{Kan me get jernal from Ly-brair-eee?}{}{-4}{}{90}{}
{90}{You’d think so, wouldn’t you? Of course, you’re right. You want the book, go to the Library and talk to the Librarian. Ask her for ‘The Story of Amtut’. It’s the published journal of that adventurer I told you about. Once you've read it, come back here and tell me. Okay? Heh! At least this guy was left alive to write a book!}{You’d think so, wouldn’t you? Of course, you’re right. You want the book, go to the Library and talk to the Librarian. Ask her for ‘The Story of Amtut’. It’s the published journal of that adventurer I told you about. Once you've read it, come back here and tell me. Okay? Heh! At least this guy was left alive to write a book!}{}{}{}{qu 1401 2}
