{140}{Yes, this guy. Didn’t I tell you? We had another adventurer wander through town about two weeks before DarkUnderlord. Claimed he was looking for some ‘Half-Ogre Breeding Farm’. Anyway, he went up into the old mines and never came out. Eventually though, his body mysteriously appeared near one of the farms. No-one will talk about it now. He was buried in the forest somewhere.}{Yes, this guy. Didn’t I tell you? We had another adventurer wander through town about two weeks before DarkUnderlord. Claimed he was looking for some ‘Half-Ogre Breeding Farm’. Anyway, he went up into the old mines and never came out. Eventually though, his body mysteriously appeared near one of the farms. No-one will talk about it now. He was buried in the forest somewhere.}{}{}{}{}
