{2040}{The mayor is calling it a splendid victory. But that book says a soul can remain trapped in the remains. I wonder how splendid it seems down there.}{The mayor is calling it a splendid victory. But that book says a soul can remain trapped in the remains. I wonder how splendid it seems down there.}{}{}{}{}
